Press patch 0002: take init_telemetry from Press, not from Frappe.
Purpose: Frappe 16 removed frappe.utils.telemetry.init_telemetry. Press already defines the same
helper in press/utils/telemetry.py (reads posthog_host and posthog_project_id; does nothing
when they are unset). The product trial request module then imports on Frappe 16.
Upstream: proposal 2 in backend/docs/press-python314-upstream.md (Press issue 7534).
Remove when Press ships this change (decision O-51 in backend/PROJECT-RECORD.md).

